{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012T1mauT9rj3MwXgecN8efH","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 11\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 方案: ACE05 上验证 structural consistency vs Fleiss'' Kappa 的 correlation\\\\n    差异'\\\\n  rationale: 'PMC12888769 用 surface-level Fleiss'' Kappa 在 zero-shot 模型上得到 ρ=0.20-0.28，我们假设\\\\n    fine-tuned 模型 + structural consistency (soft Jaccard) 能达到 ρ≥0.40。这是整个论文的基础假设——如果\\\\n    structural consistency 不能更好地预测准确率，后续的 adaptive gating 无从谈起。Phase 0 pilot 设计: Qwen3-8B\\\\n    fine-tuned on ACE05, N=8 samples, 200 instances, 对比两种 consistency metric 的 Spearman\\\\n    ρ。Pass ≥0.40, Fail <0.30。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 审查意见，收紧 MVP pass/fail 标准\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出 5 个问题，全部合理采纳：(1) PASS 必须要求 EAE (high-headroom subtask) ρ≥0.40，仅\\\\n    NER 通过不够（ceiling effect 可能虚高）；(2) MARGINAL 区间加 time-boxed protocol: N=16 追加 +\\\\n    1天上限；(3) 加 fine-tuning 质量门控 (NER≥73, EAE≥45)，模型不行时先修 fine-tuning；(4) ACE05 今天必须确认；(5)\\\\n    监控 T=1.0 per-sample F1 分布，>30% F1=0 时追加 T=0.7。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: SciERC RE 替代 ACE05 EAE 作为 MVP high-headroom subtask\\\\n  rationale: ACE05 需 LDC 许可，用户未确认。SciERC 公开可得，有 NER+RE 两个 subtask。RE base F1 ~47（与\\\\n    ACE05 EAE ~52 相当），结构复杂度高（entity pair + relation type），headroom 大，是 EAE 的合理替代。PASS\\\\n    标准更新为 RE ρ≥0.40。需要补实现 RE 的 consistency + evaluation + pipeline 支持。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Gate 0: NER PASS (60.4%), RE FAIL (33.8%). 执行方案 C——当前模型先跑 pilot + 追训改进版，需修复\\\\n    RE evaluation'\\\\n  rationale: RE 33.8% 低于 40% 阈值但不阻塞 pilot：(1) headroom 大，oracle best-of-N 有提升空间；(2)\\\\n    consistency correlation 不要求高绝对 F1，要求 per-instance variance；(3) 弱模型上验证假设结论更强。但\\\\n    Reviewer 发现两个评估缺陷必须先修：(a) 28% test instances 无 gold relations，会在 (consistency=1.0,\\\\n    F1=0) 处制造 artifact，必须排除；(b) 需报告 full ρ 和 conditional ρ（排除 all-samples-F1=0 的 instances），隔离\\\\n    knowledge-gap cluster 的稀释效应。方向反转是系统性错误（consistent wrongness），恰好对应 error taxonomy\\\\n    中的 \\\\\\\"systematic errors\\\\\\\" 类别——本身是有价值的分析数据点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_001\\\\n    role: gate0_eval\\\\n    result: NER 60.4% PASS, RE 33.8% FAIL\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP pilot ft_001 结果：FAIL but positive signals. 等 ft_002 结果再做最终判定。\\\\n  rationale: ft_001 pilot 核心数据：RE ρ_sj_full=0.254 (FAIL <0.40), NER ρ_sj=0.362 (接近)。但\\\\n    conditional ρ（排除 knowledge-gap instances 后）显示正面信号：RE conditional ρ_sj=0.352 >\\\\n    ρ_fk=0.311 (Δ=+0.041)，NER conditional ρ_sj=0.369 > ρ_fk=0.357。核心假设\\\\\\\"structural\\\\n    > surface\\\\\\\"在控制 knowledge-gap 后成立。Oracle headroom 极大 (NER +16.9pp, RE +21.7pp)，TTS\\\\n    有巨大潜力。ft_002 (LoRA r=32, 5 epochs) 正在训练，如果 RE F1 提升到 ≥40%，knowledge-gap 减少可能将\\\\n    ρ_sj 推过 0.40。Parse failures 偏高，ft_002 pilot 需增加 max_tokens。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_001\\\\n    role: mvp_pilot\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: RE ρ_sj_full=0.254, NER ρ_sj=0.362. Conditional: RE 0.352, NER\\\\n      0.369. Oracle headroom: RE +21.7pp, NER +16.9pp'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: Narrative 选择方案 A (stay-the-course)：等 ft_002_v2 改进 RE 后重跑 pilot，保留强 claim\\\\n  rationale: ft_001 pilot FAIL (RE full ρ_sj=0.254 <0.30)，但诊断结论是模型 RE 质量不足而非假设方向错误。证据：(1)\\\\n    NER 方向全面正确 (SJ>FK, ρ=0.362)；(2) RE conditional ρ=0.352 进入 MARGINAL 且 SJ>FK (+0.041)；(3)\\\\n    58.3% RE samples F1=0 是 knowledge-gap 噪声淹没信号。ft_002_v2 (LoRA r=32, 5 epochs, 降\\\\n    batch + gradient checkpointing 防 OOM) 预期 RE F1 提升到 ≥40%，减少 knowledge-gap instances，将\\\\n    ρ 推向 0.40。成本仅 ~2h (训练 30min + pilot 60min)。如果 ft_002_v2 也不过，conditional ρ 分析作为\\\\n    fallback analytical contribution。不选 B (NER-only 太弱) 或 C (纯 conditional 有 cherry-picking\\\\n    风险)。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_001\\\\n    role: pilot\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: RE full ρ=0.254, cond ρ=0.352; NER ρ=0.362'\\\\n  - exp_id: ft_002\\\\n    role: retrain\\\\n    result: OOM at step 73, restarting as ft_002_v2\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: Gate 1 FAIL (RE rho_sj=0.244<0.30), 但 T=1.0 zero rate 44%>30% 触发协议内 T=0.7\\\\n    追加，暂不 pivot\\\\n  rationale: 1) RE full rho_sj=0.244 < 0.30 触发 ROADMAP FAIL 路径；2) 但 44.3% RE F1=0\\\\n    > 30% 阈值，按 Gate 1 设计追加 T=0.7 实验——这是协议预设步骤不是补救；3) RE cond rho_sj=0.316 > 0.30 说明排除\\\\n    all-zero 后进入 MARGINAL 区间，SJ 在\\\\\\\"可做\\\\\\\"实例上仍有信号；4) NER rho_sj=0.383 稳定正面；5) SJ vs FK\\\\n    翻转值得关注但可能与高 zero rate 有关，T=0.7 可能改善。最终 pivot 决策等 T=0.7 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: Gate 1 pilot (ft_002_v2)\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.244 FAIL, NER rho_sj=0.383 PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_003\\\\n    role: Gate 1 pilot (ft_001) baseline\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.237, NER rho_sj=0.381\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: E1 否定乘性惩罚假设，Narrative B 排除，确认走 Narrative A (NER-primary + RE diagnostic)\\\\n  rationale: E1 component-wise 分析：head_sj ρ=0.210 远低于 NER ρ=0.383（差 17pp），所有单组件 ρ\\\\n    都低于组合 SJ（0.244），加法/乘法聚合几乎相同（0.243 vs 0.244）。结论：RE consistency 信号本质弱于 NER，是复合错误传播的固有属性，不是\\\\n    metric 设计问题。Narrative B（度量分解修复 RE）不可行。Narrative A（NER 为主 + RE 诊断分析）是唯一可行路径。pilot_005\\\\n    (T=0.7) 作为最后确认仍在运行，设硬截止线：RE rho_sj < 0.30 = 确认 FAIL，不再调参。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: e1_component_wise_re_sj\\\\n    role: RE SJ 分解诊断\\\\n    result: 乘性惩罚假设 REJECTED，head_sj ρ=0.210 << NER 0.383\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: Gate 1 数据源\\\\n    result: RE rho_sj=0.244 FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_005\\\\n    role: T=0.7 最后确认\\\\n    result: 运行中\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: E1 否定乘性惩罚假说，方案 B 排除，确认走方案 A（NER-primary + RE 诊断）\\\\n  rationale: E1 component-wise 分解显示 head_sj ρ=0.210 远低于 NER ρ=0.383，每个 component 单独都比乘性组合差——问题是\\\\n    span-level SJ 对 relation 任务根本缺乏区分力，不是聚合公式问题。additive fix 也无效（ρ差0.001）。方案 B（度量分解\\\\n    pivot）无法修复 RE。方案 A 可行：NER 强正向（ρ=0.383, SJ>FK 12pp, p=7e-20）作为 core claim + RE\\\\n    分解作为诊断贡献。下一步：NER 多数据集验证 + N=16 扩展。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: e1_component_wise_re_sj\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: 乘性惩罚假说 REJECTED, head_sj ρ=0.210 << NER ρ=0.383\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: Gate 1 base\\\\n    result: RE FAIL, NER PASS\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: pilot_005 T=0.7 确认 RE full FAIL (rho=0.234<0.30)，但 RE cond rho_sj=0.372\\\\n    全系列最高，SJ>FK 11.8pp。MVP 结论：NER PASS + RE conditional positive + RE full FAIL。进入\\\\n    research 阶段走 Narrative A。\\\\n  rationale: 1) RE full rho_sj=0.234 < 0.30 硬截止线，确认 FAIL，不再调参；2) 但 RE conditional\\\\n    rho_sj=0.372（接近0.40），SJ>FK优势11.8pp——T=0.7自然分离knowledge-gap vs uncertainty两类错误，恰好支撑核心论点；3)\\\\n    T=1.0时FK反超SJ是采样噪声伪像（FK从0.278降到0.184），SJ在conditional set上实际增强；4) NER rho_sj=0.388全系列最高，SJ>FK稳健(p=2e-20)；5)\\\\n    MVP整体：假设部分验证——entity-level有效，relation-level需capability-aware分析。数据足够支撑Narrative\\\\n    A + 丰富的诊断分析。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_005\\\\n    role: T=0.7最后确认\\\\n    result: RE full rho=0.234 FAIL; RE cond rho=0.372 SJ>FK 11.8pp; NER rho=0.388\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_004\\\\n    role: T=1.0 baseline\\\\n    result: RE full rho=0.244; RE cond rho=0.316\\\\n  - exp_id: e1_component_wise_re_sj\\\\n    role: 度量分解诊断\\\\n    result: 乘性假设REJECTED\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 7003, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HKfzCDwhxMENhz8xdBgfGN","session_id":"37f786ee-7832-4fe8-ada0-13058d333aba","uuid":"1840c174-8002-48e0-884e-0022ffd6d1e8","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:22:33.526Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Wx2LobJoMXAUqvGdTxhGen","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fp47dhaLqagUw6FY432o3D","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"struct_self_consist_ie","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1336,"cache_read_input_tokens":17465,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1336,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HKfzCDwhxMENhz8xdBgfGN","session_id":"37f786ee-7832-4fe8-ada0-13058d333aba","uuid":"72174c7f-3ac8-480b-951c-f946ed9c7cf1"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fp47dhaLqagUw6FY432o3D","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — struct_self_consist_ie\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (via ARR May 2026)\\\\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\\\\n- Deadline: ARR May cycle, 2026-05-25\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (2 条)\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 1 (Positive — NER)\\\\nFor entity-level information extraction, structural self-consistency (soft Jaccard over structured outputs) provides a significantly stronger confidence signal than surface agreement (Fleiss' Kappa), enabling effective test-time scaling through consistency-based sample selection.\\\\n\\\\n**MVP evidence**: NER rho_sj=0.388 (below 0.40 threshold but statistically significant advantage over FK: +12pp, p=2e-20), oracle headroom +5.5pp. N=16 (exp-001) may push rho past 0.40; if not, the 0.388 vs FK's 0.322 gap with p=2e-20 is the stronger argument.\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 2 (Diagnostic — RE + boundary condition)\\\\nThe effectiveness of consistency-based confidence is governed by task structural complexity: compound error propagation in relational tasks fundamentally degrades the consistency-accuracy correlation on the full instance set, but the signal remains valid within the model's capability range (conditional instances). This establishes a principled boundary for when structural consistency works as a TTS signal.\\\\n\\\\n**MVP evidence**: RE full rho_sj=0.234 (FAIL), RE cond rho_sj=0.372 (SJ>FK +11.8pp). Component decomposition (E1) shows all RE components equally weak (head_sj rho=0.210), ruling out metric design as cause. T=0.7 naturally separates knowledge-gap vs uncertainty errors.\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n\\\\n**Problem**: Test-time scaling (TTS) through sampling + selection requires a reliable confidence signal. Self-consistency has shown promise in reasoning tasks (majority voting), but structured prediction (IE) poses unique challenges: outputs have internal structure (entities, relations, triplets), and simple surface agreement ignores structural similarity.\\\\n\\\\n**Existing approaches & gaps**: Self-consistency in LLM reasoning uses exact-match voting on final answers. For structured prediction, no systematic study exists on whether structural similarity between sampled outputs correlates with accuracy. Fleiss' Kappa measures surface agreement but treats structured outputs as flat tokens, missing structural information.\\\\n\\\\n**Our framing**: We introduce structural self-consistency (soft Jaccard) as a confidence signal for IE test-time scaling. Unlike prior work on reasoning self-consistency, we operate on structured outputs where the metric choice fundamentally matters. We discover a task-complexity boundary: structural consistency is a strong signal for entity-level tasks (NER) where errors are independent, but degrades for relational tasks (RE) where compound error propagation across head/tail/type components amplifies noise. This diagnostic finding provides practical guidance on when TTS works for structured prediction.\\\\n\\\\n**Headline result template**: \\\\\\\"On SciERC NER, structural self-consistency achieves rho=0.39 correlation with accuracy (vs rho=0.32 for Fleiss' Kappa, p<1e-19), enabling +X F1 improvement through best-of-N selection. However, on relation extraction, full-set correlation drops to rho=0.23 due to compound error propagation — though conditional analysis (within-capability instances) recovers rho=0.37 with SJ>FK by 12pp.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n\\\\n### R1: \\\\\\\"Only one NER dataset — generalization unclear\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: exp-002 (CoNLL-2003) + exp-003 (OntoNotes) validate cross-dataset\\\\n- **Priority**: P0, must address before submission\\\\n\\\\n### R2: \\\\\\\"Only one model family (Qwen3-8B)\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: exp-007 (LLaMA-3.1-8B or similar) shows model-agnostic effect\\\\n- **Priority**: P1, strongly recommended\\\\n\\\\n### R3: \\\\\\\"RE negative result makes the contribution narrow\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: Frame Claim 2 as diagnostic contribution — identifying WHY and WHEN consistency fails is as valuable as showing it works. Component decomposition + temperature sensitivity provide mechanistic explanation.\\\\n- **Priority**: Addressed by framing, reinforced by exp-004 (RE diagnostic analysis)\\\\n\\\\n### R4: \\\\\\\"No actual TTS improvement demonstrated\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: exp-006 (adaptive compute demo) shows concrete F1 gains from SJ-based selection vs random vs FK\\\\n- **Priority**: P1, high impact\\\\n\\\\n### R5: \\\\\\\"Sample size N=8 may be too small for reliable SJ estimation\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: exp-001 (N=16) tests scaling effect on NER; if rho improves, demonstrates N-sensitivity\\\\n- **Priority**: P0\\\\n\\\\n### R6: \\\\\\\"Conditional analysis cherry-picks favorable instances\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **Mitigation**: All-zero instances represent fundamental knowledge gaps (model consistently fails), not borderline cases. The separation is principled: consistency should measure uncertainty, not inability. Temperature analysis (T=0.7 increases all-zero count while improving conditional rho) supports this interpretation.\\\\n- **Priority**: Addressed by analysis in paper\\\\n\\\\n## Venue Fit\\\\n\\\\nEMNLP is well-suited for:\\\\n- NLP-focused analysis of IE methods\\\\n- Empirical studies with diagnostic findings\\\\n- Negative results that provide principled explanations\\\\n\\\\nRisk: purely analytical paper without a new method. Mitigation: structural self-consistency + the diagnostic framework ARE the methodological contributions; the findings provide actionable guidelines.\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 5246, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HKfzCDwhxMENhz8xdBgfGN","session_id":"37f786ee-7832-4fe8-ada0-13058d333aba","uuid":"37d1ee9e-e4e6-4c67-9804-64fbefac0977","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:22:34.478Z"}
